-<tr class="memdesc:ab6eb73ceef584fc23c8c8097926dce42"><td class="mdescLeft">&#160;</td><td class="mdescRight">The width of the cropping region.  <a href="#ab6eb73ceef584fc23c8c8097926dce42">More...</a><br/></td></tr>
